  "body": "## 🤖 AI-Generated Changelog\n\n## Added\n- Added a new `uv` resolver backend as an alternative to the default pip-based resolver, providing faster dependency resolution\n\n## Changed\n- Vendored pip 26.3 with rebased Pipenv patches\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed suppression of Safety warnings in quiet mode during `pipenv scan`, preserving stderr output appropriately\n- Fixed VCS entries losing their environment markers when using `--no-lock`\n- Fixed latent bugs identified by CodeQL code quality analysis\n\n---\n\n🔗 **Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/pipenv/compare/v2026.10.6...v2026.11.0\n"
